OL,3,AConsultant doctors in England to strike
OL,4,Anext month
OL,5,
OL,6,FConsultant doctors in England are to
OL,7,Fstage a two-day strike next month in a
OL,8,Fdispute over pay and working
OL,9,Fconditions.
OL,11,FThe walkout will begin on 25 November
OL,12,Fat 06:59 GMT, with consultants staffing
OL,13,Femergency care only.
OL,15,FThis is known as Christmas Day cover
OL,16,Fand is likely to have a major impact on
OL,17,Fmost routine and elective or planned
OL,18,Fservices.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
