OL,3,AConsultant doctors in England to strike
OL,4,Anext month
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe announcement comes after talks had
OL,7,Fbeen taking place with the government
OL,8,Fover the past month, following the vote
OL,9,Fin favour of strike action by British
OL,10,FMedical Association members in July.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
